[CENTER][SIZE=7][B]AuraUtils[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4]Lightweight utility plugin for Spigot, Paper, Purpur & Folia[/SIZE]

[SIZE=3]Homes · Warps · TPA (trusted/instant) · Back · RTP · God · Fly · NoFall · NoHunger · GUI[/SIZE]
[/CENTER]

[HR][/HR]

[B][SIZE=5]Features[/SIZE][/B]

[LIST]
[*][B]Homes[/B] — /home, /sethome, /delhome (per-player, optional GUI)
[*][B]Warps[/B] — /warp, /setwarp, /delwarp (server-wide, optional GUI)
[*][B]TPA[/B] — /tpa, /tpaccept, /tpadeny, /tpacancel with timed requests
[*][B]Trusted TPA[/B] — /tpatrust, /tpauntrust — friends on your list can TPA without confirmation
[*][B]Back[/B] — /back to last teleport location
[*][B]RTP[/B] — /rtp safe random teleport with bounded attempts
[*][B]God / Fly / NoFall / NoHunger[/B] — persistent toggles with proper Spigot & Paper behaviour
[*][B]Shared teleport countdown[/B] — chat / actionbar / title, cancel-on-move, cancel-on-damage, rising-pitch sounds
[*][B]aura.teleport.bypass[/B] — instant teleports for staff
[*][B]Utility GUI[/B] — /menu
[*][B]/aura[/B] — quick info and command list
[/LIST]

[B]Trusted TPA:[/B] Add a player with [ICODE]/tpatrust <player>[/ICODE]. They can [ICODE]/tpa[/ICODE] you without [ICODE]/tpaccept[/ICODE]. List with [ICODE]/tpatrust list[/ICODE], remove with [ICODE]/tpauntrust <player>[/ICODE].

[HR][/HR]

[B][SIZE=5]Compatibility[/SIZE][/B]

[LIST]
[*][B]Minecraft[/B]: 1.21.x (tested to 1.21.11) [B]and[/B] 26.1 / 26.2 (year-based numbering)
[*][B]Server[/B]: Spigot, Paper, Purpur, and [B]Folia[/B]
[*][B]Java[/B]: 21+ (plugin). 26.1+ servers require Java 25; the same JAR runs on both.
[*][B]One JAR[/B] covers both version lines — no separate downloads needed.
[*][B]Folia[/B]: entity/region schedulers for countdowns, teleports, RTP, and fly re-apply
[*][B]Geyser / Floodgate[/B]: works via standard Bukkit APIs
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[B][SIZE=5]Installation[/SIZE][/B]

[LIST=1]
[*]Download the JAR from this resource page
[*]Place it in your server [ICODE]plugins/[/ICODE] folder
[*]Restart the server
[*](Optional) Edit [ICODE]plugins/AuraUtils/config.yml[/ICODE]
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[B][SIZE=5]What's new in 1.2.0[/SIZE][/B]

[LIST]
[*][B]Trusted / instant TPA[/B] — [ICODE]/tpatrust[/ICODE], [ICODE]/tpauntrust[/ICODE], permission [ICODE]aura.tpa.trust[/ICODE]
[*]Config: [ICODE]tpa.trusted-max[/ICODE], [ICODE]tpa.trusted-instant[/ICODE]
[*]Folia-safe concurrent storage for trusted lists and pending TPA
[/LIST]

Earlier: [B]1.1.0[/B] Folia support · [B]1.1.1[/B] Folia RTP & /back fixes · [B]1.0.0[/B] core utilities

[HR][/HR]

[B][SIZE=5]Metrics[/SIZE][/B]

This plugin uses [URL=https://bstats.org/plugin/bukkit/AuraUtils/33574]bStats[/URL] (anonymous). You can disable it in [ICODE]plugins/bStats/config.yml[/ICODE] → [ICODE]enabled: false[/ICODE].
